## 🚀 About The Project

**SHIVANKVERSE AI NEWS AGENT** is an AI agent project focused on autonomous technology news discovery and content creation.

Our vision is to build an intelligent system that can independently:

- Discover the latest technology news.
- Analyze and research important stories.
- Identify trending technology topics.
- Generate original Hindi SEO articles.
- Verify information using multiple sources.
- Request human approval before publishing.
- Publish approved articles to Blogger.

